// The tree generator: the Tree template (a trunk, up to four levels of branches, a crown
// envelope and leaf cards or needle fronds as props, grown as a bark and a foliage MeshGraph
// shape with levels of detail), the bark and leaf materials of the species with their texture
// graphs, and the presets of the species (TreeBeech, TreeOak, TreeBirch, TreeSpruce, TreeFir,
// TreePine, TreeWillow and TreeSnag) with an age to grow them young.
//
// A scene includes this, then places the trees, such as trees.flecs. The Scene needs
// alpha_cutout, diffuse_transmission and wind, and triplanar for the bark.
include textures
include materials
include tree
include presets
